    19	 * relying on this side to find + compile the source locally from
    20	 * `connector_key`. This saves the ~13 MB inline blob in poll responses
    21	 * (lobu#771 postmortem trail; lobu#772 perf fix). Device workers and
    22	 * DB-only user-uploaded connectors still receive `compiled_code`
    23	 * directly — they don't have the connector source on disk.
    24	 *
    25	 * Gateway and worker images have different paths to the bundled source,
    26	 * so the gateway sends only `connector_key` and each side resolves it
    27	 * against its own filesystem.
